        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alung rianra gan khou",
            "Poubaomei sam guang o alung khou;",
            "Namthan dai khou lauziu narui gaan bammei tei",
            "Dinlou o karam gai,",
            "Lung rianramei dikhou ai bamsan khou.",
            "",
            "Kahim daimei lat tei",
            "Ai rui sa-ngam thui mak;",
            "Kau siammiu khuan gaimei",
            "Thuan kumei siammiu khuan",
            "Gaimei akhang.",
            "",
            "2. Khou tei ai guang tang khang",
            "Kandi rianramei rui ding khamna",
            "Ai rui khuanlian lakmei namthan ata tihou;",
            "Alung rui ning ngam mak",
            "Salem namthan hou khang ai khuanlian lak.",
            "",
            "3. Tingsaeng neilamei lu",
            "Ntam dat nipui lat sa mak khe;",
            "Theihmei dui kaan pukhou apu rui zian lou na",
            "Ata chaengriu pukhou",
            "Zaengsi mikdui keimei naizat lak khe.",
            "",
            "4. Kandi kabam ‘thui khou",
            "Rianra zaengsimei rui gumliam the;",
            "Kum sini tingkao ram ai guang tang pui nung kiu",
            "Thanmei banchra guai le",
            "Guangh lauziu Nata tingsaeng thuan bamni."
          ]
        }
      }
